{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07675","headline":"入峡寄弟 · 孟浩然","name":"入峡寄弟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾昔与尔辈，读书常闭门。\n未尝冒湍险，岂顾垂堂言。\n自此历江湖，辛勤难具论。\n往来行旅弊，开凿禹功存。\n壁立千峰峻，潨流万壑奔。\n我来凡几宿，无夕不闻猿。\n浦上摇归恋，舟中失梦魂。\n泪沾明月峡，心断鶺鴒原。\n离阔星难聚，秋深露已繁。\n因君下南楚，书此示乡园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}